[{"id":3759416072,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gFCMI","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]","type":"Bot","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D"},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR fixes a regression in Godot 4.6 where `ClassDB::get_class_list()` and `ClassDB::get_extensions_class_list()` no longer return alphabetically sorted lists as they did in version 4.5.1. The issue was introduced when `SortArray<StringName>` was used without specifying the `StringName::AlphCompare` comparator, causing sorting to fall back to pointer comparison instead of alphabetical ordering.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Fixed `ClassDB::get_class_list()` to use alphabetical comparator for sorting\n- Fixed `ClassDB::get_extensions_class_list()` to use alphabetical comparator for sorting\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/godotengine/godot/new/master/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115923#pullrequestreview-3759416072","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115923","author_association":"NONE","submitted_at":"2026-02-05T20:55:17Z"},{"id":3759668897,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gF_6h","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Looks good to me. I totally missed the `AlphCompare` declaration, and I agree we should be going back, if possible in a 4.6 minor version.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115923#pullrequestreview-3759668897","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115923","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-05T21:54:54Z"},{"id":3762732370,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gRr1S","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"02a3ada50224e1cdc95077ee0d67d633ff904d7f","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"I added the fix to ScriptServer, so this is good to go now.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115923#pullrequestreview-3762732370","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115923","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-06T12:09:59Z"}]